  "title": "Spicy Pear Cookies",
  "description": "This spicy pear cookie recipe has a rich flavor and can be made with or without frosting. Top them with walnut halves for a crunchy, fancy touch.",
  "authors": [
    "Cheryl Statt"
  ],
